WEBVTT

00:42:58.099 --> 00:43:00.520
DF: Focus on what you learned,

00:43:00.544 --> 00:43:02.383
and the people that you met.

00:43:02.407 --> 00:43:05.416
Because what no one can take from you

00:43:05.440 --> 00:43:08.181
is your knowledge and your relationships.

00:43:08.205 --> 00:43:10.551
And if you invest in those,

00:43:10.575 --> 00:43:13.705
and you manage those correctly,

00:43:13.729 --> 00:43:16.192
you'll be able to cash them in later.

00:43:16.216 --> 00:43:19.713
So whether the brand becomes tarnished

00:43:19.737 --> 00:43:21.983
or the company doesn't do well,

00:43:22.007 --> 00:43:24.792
if you've built
person-to-person relationship

00:43:24.816 --> 00:43:28.177
rather than person-to-brand relationship,

00:43:28.201 --> 00:43:32.507
then you'll be able
to leverage that later.